        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20525370?u=d7c703d1d8974c5837ca617d54e4a1ff85eb7721&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR primarily introduces a new GitHub Action workflow to effectively do a full Hydra evaluation for every PR, paving the way towards relieving ofborg of its evaluation duty. This is motivated by <a href=\"https://discourse.nixos.org/t/infrastructure-announcement-the-future-of-ofborg-your-help-needed/56025\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discourse.nixos.org/t/infrastructure-announcement-the-future-of-ofborg-your-help-needed/56025</a>, see also <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2657939978\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/355847\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/355847/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/355847\">#355847</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To make this as efficient as possible, 4 workflow jobs are spawned in parallel (one for each supported system, as originally experimented by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Mic92/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Mic92\">@Mic92</a> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2628529812\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/352808\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/352808/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/352808\">#352808</a>), while each job makes full use of its 4 cores and 16GB of memory (based off amjoseph's idea in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2007811369\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/269403\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/269403/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/269403\">#269403</a> and initial work in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2007397433\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/269356\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/269356/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/269356\">#269356</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've also implemented it in a way that limits maximum memory usage as Nixpkgs grows. CI will only take <em>longer</em> to finish, instead of OOMing. Currently it takes about 5 minutes, check out <a href=\"https://github.com/tweag/nixpkgs/actions/runs/11927279742?pr=99\">this test run</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that ofborg does more than just evaluate Nixpkgs, but this PR can be used as a base to also implement output path comparisons to assign labels based on changed paths, to request appropriate maintainers, and do evaluation time comparisons.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ping <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/philiptaron/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/philiptaron\">@philiptaron</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Mic92/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Mic92\">@Mic92</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Erethon/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Erethon\">@Erethon</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/balsoft/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/balsoft\">@balsoft</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/JohnRTitor/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/JohnRTitor\">@JohnRTitor</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/a-kenji/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/a-kenji\">@a-kenji</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Tested a successful evaluation: <a href=\"https://github.com/tweag/nixpkgs/actions/runs/11927279742?pr=99\">https://github.com/tweag/nixpkgs/actions/runs/11927279742?pr=99</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Tested a failed evaluation: <a href=\"https://github.com/tweag/nixpkgs/actions/runs/11927816023/job/33243842672?pr=99\">https://github.com/tweag/nixpkgs/actions/runs/11927816023/job/33243842672?pr=99</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This work is funded by <a href=\"https://tweag.io\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tweag</a> and <a href=\"https://antithesis.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Antithesis</a> ✨</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add a 👍 <a href=\"https://github.blog/2016-03-10-add-reactions-to-pull-requests-issues-and-comments/\" rel=\"nofollow\">reaction</a> to <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pulls?q=is%3Aopen+sort%3Areactions-%2B1-desc\">pull requests you find important</a>.</p>",
